    {
      "question": "If two of my {Sky Island} type Characters with 6000 base power or more would be simultaneously removed from the field by my opponent's effect, can I choose to add 1 card from the top of my Life cards to my hand instead?",
      "answer": "Yes, you can. In this case, you may keep both of the targeted {Sky Island} type Characters with 6000 base power or more on the field by adding 1 card from the top of your Life cards to your hand.",
